Defect: SMI-UNPUBLISHED-MODULE https://pysnmp.github.io/pysmi/stable/mib-defects.html#smi-unpublished-module

The module imports QosService FROM INT-SERV-MIB, the same unpublished
name CISCO-VISM-TRAPS-MIB gives. RFC 2213 publishes the Integrated
Services MIB as INTEGRATED-SERVICES-MIB, which is what defines the
QosService textual convention.

The repair is the published spelling.

--- a/CISCO-VOICE-DIAL-CONTROL-MIB
+++ b/CISCO-VOICE-DIAL-CONTROL-MIB
@@ -38,7 +38,7 @@
     callActivePeerId
         FROM DIAL-CONTROL-MIB
     QosService
-        FROM INT-SERV-MIB
+        FROM INTEGRATED-SERVICES-MIB
     ifIndex,
     InterfaceIndexOrZero
         FROM IF-MIB
